Maintainer: astrovm <~@4st.li>
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-themes
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/astrovm/amyos
Description: Amy OS name and logo for Ubuntu
 Renames the system to Amy OS in os-release, the GRUB menu and the boot
 splash. The system still identifies as Ubuntu (ID=ubuntu), so Ubuntu
 tools and repositories keep working.
